ndering. The bank says the penalty will reduce its third-quarter earnings.", "lead_zh": "美国监管机构对美国银行开出12.1亿美元罚单，原因是该行未能发现可能的洗钱活动。银行表示，这笔罚款将拉低第三季度利润。", "preview": "The US Treasury Department said the fine is the third-largest in its history. It was imposed because the bank failed to report more than $5b", "preview_zh": "美国财政部表示，这是该部门历史上第三大罚单。处罚原因是该行未能报告超过50亿美元的可疑活动，其中10亿美元涉及国家安全及其他重点非法金融风险。财政部长斯科特·贝森特表示，当如此规模的银行未能履行反洗钱义务时，整个美国金融体系都会面临严重风险。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 649, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/67/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 101.875, "size_bytes": 612144, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 275, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/67/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 102.975, "size_bytes": 618768, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 275, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/67/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/67/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 108.975, "size_bytes": 654768, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 275, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/67/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/67/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 94.65, "size_bytes": 568800, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 275, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/67/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/67/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 103.05, "size_bytes": 619200, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 275, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/67/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_u